<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: man-portable SAM launcher -->
  <DMSE_Apparel_SamLauncher.label>防空導彈發射具</DMSE_Apparel_SamLauncher.label>
  <!-- EN: A shoulder-fired anti-air launcher with a simple friend-or-foe antenna and a helmet-linked sight. It is carried on the back, leaving the hands free for a main weapon. The user must stand still to lock on.\n\nLoad with light surface-to-air missiles. It fires at incoming threats already tracked by your radar network on this map, and needs no fire-control channel.\n\nIt can also be loaded by hand with Sabre light loitering munitions, which it fires only at ground targets, with a much longer reach. -->
  <DMSE_Apparel_SamLauncher.description>一具肩射式防空發射器，配有簡易敵我識別天線與連動頭盔的瞄準具。背在身後，雙手仍能使用主武器。使用者必須站定才能鎖定目標。\n\n裝填輕型防空導彈。會射擊雷達網已在本地圖追蹤到的來襲目標，不佔用火控通道。\n\n也能手動裝填軍刀輕型巡飛彈，只能對地面目標發射，但射程遠得多。</DMSE_Apparel_SamLauncher.description>
  <!-- EN: missile -->
  <DMSE_Apparel_SamLauncher.comps.CompManPortableSAM.chargeNoun>導彈</DMSE_Apparel_SamLauncher.comps.CompManPortableSAM.chargeNoun>
